@startuml
title AIMS shipping policy refactor (implemented)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
interface WeightStrategy {
  +chargeable_weight(items): Decimal
}
class ActualWeightStrategy {
  +chargeable_weight(items): Decimal
}
class AimsShippingPolicy {
  -weight_strategy: WeightStrategy
  +calculate(province, items, order_value): Decimal
  +fee(province, weight, order_value): Decimal
}
class OrderService {
  +delivery_preview()
  +save_delivery()
}
ActualWeightStrategy ..|> WeightStrategy
AimsShippingPolicy o--> WeightStrategy
OrderService --> AimsShippingPolicy : current tariff
note right of WeightStrategy
  Future volumetric strategy is only an
  extension scenario, not implemented.
end note
@enduml
